cotton-900">Climate-Smart Cotton: Developing Precision Regenerative Practices and Market Opportunities for Addressing Climate Change in the Cotton Belt</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-cotton-900/70">USDA-NIFA SAS-CAP<!-- --> | Award No. <!-- -->2024-68012-41750<!-- --> | Project period: <!-- -->2024-2029</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-cotton-900/70">Lead institution: <!-- -->Texas A&amp;M AgriLife Research<!-- --> | PI/Lead: <!-- -->Muthukumar Bagavathiannan<!-- --> | Project Manager: <!-- -->Deepak Loura</p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-y border-cotton-200 bg-white py-16 md:py-20"><div class="container-page grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-cotton-700">Project at a Glance</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-cotton-900 sm:text-4xl">Fast facts for collaborators, stakeholders, and visitors</h2><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-cotton-900/70">The SmartCotton project brings together a multi-state research network to develop precision regenerative practices and market opportunities for climate-smart cotton.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-lg border border-cotton-200 bg-cotton-50 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-cotton-700">Funding program</p><p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-cotton-900">USDA-NIFA SAS-CAP</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-cotton-200 bg-cotton-50 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-cotton-700">Award number</p><p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-cotton-900">2024-68012-41750</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-cotton-200 bg-cotton-50 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-cotton-700">Project period</p><p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-cotton-900">2024-2029</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-cotton-2